    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1064">

                <pb facs="0788" n="672" xml:id="pg672"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/3745.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consular Agent Ulmer to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ciudad, Juarez</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 23, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I beg that you advise me immediately what I shall do in behalf of Americans at
                    Torreon, Velardena, and Durango, eighty-five in number. These citizens depend on
                    me solely and entirely for instructions as to their safety. My telegrams to them
                    on the situation are either refused or delayed. Must I send special messenger?
                    Wire me immediately, care Hotel Sheldon.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">I. M. Ulmer</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
